Hmm... get one of the HP NC7771 GbE NICs off of ebay (I got one for
1EUR) and reflash it to identify itself as a DEGPA-TX[1] and enjoy the
increased network speed? That'd probably the simplest option and one
which provides a seamless upgrade path to your existing solution. And
